{{also|Luke|lûke|lǚkè}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|luke}}, {{m|enm|leuke}}, {{m|enm|lewke||lukewarm, tepid}}, from an unexplained variant or extension of {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|lewe||warm, lukewarm, tepid}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|hlēow||warm}}, perhaps due to confusion with {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|wlæc||tepid, lukewarm, cool}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|British|archaic}} [[lukewarm]]
